  "summary": {
    "en": "Pricing plans as cards, with a billing period control above them. Prices roll when the period or the seat count changes; the saving is said in words next to the control.",
    "id": "Paket harga sebagai card, dengan kontrol periode pembayaran di atasnya. Harga bergulir saat periode atau jumlah peserta berubah; penghematannya disebut dengan kata-kata di samping kontrol."
  },
  "titleId": "Plans",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Monthly or yearly, with seats",
        "desc": "Market stall rental from a fictional city market office. Switch the period and change the number of stalls: the prices roll, the words morph.",
        "html": "<div data-lds-billing style=\"width: 100%;\">\n  <div class=\"billing\">\n    <div class=\"seg seg--lg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Billing period\" data-lds-segmented><span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span><button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-billing=\"month\">Monthly</button><button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-billing=\"year\">Yearly</button></div>\n    <span class=\"billing__save\">Yearly saves 2 months</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"plans\">\n    <article class=\"plan plan--featured\" aria-labelledby=\"pl-1\">\n      <div class=\"plan__head\"><h3 class=\"plan__name\" id=\"pl-1\">Kiosk</h3><p class=\"plan__desc\">One closed kiosk at Pasar Tugu, Tanjung Karang Timur.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"plan__price\"><span class=\"plan__amount\"><span class=\"plan__currency\">Rp</span><span class=\"roll\" data-price-month=\"360\" data-price-year=\"300\" data-lds-roll-label=\"{n} thousand rupiah a month\"></span></span><span class=\"plan__period morph\" data-lds-morph data-billing-month=\"thousand a month\" data-billing-year=\"thousand a month, paid yearly\">thousand a month</span></div>\n      <ul class=\"plan__list\"><li><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Electricity and water meter included</li><li><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Daily waste pickup</li></ul>\n      <div class=\"plan__cta\"><button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--block\">Apply for a kiosk</button></div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"plan\" aria-labelledby=\"pl-2\">\n      <div class=\"plan__head\"><h3 class=\"plan__name\" id=\"pl-2\">UMKM bazaar stalls</h3><p class=\"plan__desc\">Open stalls for a group of local businesses at the Saturday bazaar.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"plan__price\"><span class=\"plan__amount\"><span class=\"plan__currency\">Rp</span><span class=\"roll\" data-per-seat data-price-month=\"30\" data-price-year=\"25\" data-lds-roll-label=\"{n} thousand rupiah a month\"></span></span><span class=\"plan__period morph\" data-lds-morph data-billing-month=\"thousand a month for {seats} stalls\" data-billing-year=\"thousand a month for {seats} stalls\">thousand a month for 10 stalls</span></div>\n      <div class=\"plan__seats\"><span id=\"pl-s\">Stalls</span><div class=\"stepper-field\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"pl-s\" data-lds-stepper data-min=\"5\" data-max=\"200\" data-value=\"10\"><button aria-label=\"Fewer stalls\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">remove</span></button><span class=\"stepper-field__value\"><span class=\"roll\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></span><button aria-label=\"More stalls\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">add</span></button></div></div>\n      <div class=\"plan__cta\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--block\">Ask for a group quote</button></div>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Bulanan atau tahunan, dengan jumlah peserta",
        "desc": "Sewa tempat usaha dari kantor pasar kota fiktif. Ganti periode dan ubah jumlah lapak: harga bergulir, kata-kata berubah bentuk.",
        "html": "<div data-lds-billing style=\"width: 100%;\">\n  <div class=\"billing\">\n    <div class=\"seg seg--lg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Periode pembayaran\" data-lds-segmented><span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span><button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-billing=\"month\">Bulanan</button><button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-billing=\"year\">Tahunan</button></div>\n    <span class=\"billing__save\">Bayar tahunan hemat 2 bulan</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"plans\">\n    <article class=\"plan plan--featured\" aria-labelledby=\"pl-1\">\n      <div class=\"plan__head\"><h3 class=\"plan__name\" id=\"pl-1\">Kios</h3><p class=\"plan__desc\">Satu kios tertutup di Pasar Tugu, Tanjung Karang Timur.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"plan__price\"><span class=\"plan__amount\"><span class=\"plan__currency\">Rp</span><span class=\"roll\" data-price-month=\"360\" data-price-year=\"300\" data-lds-roll-label=\"{n} ribu rupiah per bulan\"></span></span><span class=\"plan__period morph\" data-lds-morph data-billing-month=\"ribu per bulan\" data-billing-year=\"ribu per bulan, dibayar tahunan\">ribu per bulan</span></div>\n      <ul class=\"plan__list\"><li><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Sudah termasuk meteran listrik dan air</li><li><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Angkut sampah setiap hari</li></ul>\n      <div class=\"plan__cta\"><button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--block\">Ajukan sewa kios</button></div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"plan\" aria-labelledby=\"pl-2\">\n      <div class=\"plan__head\"><h3 class=\"plan__name\" id=\"pl-2\">Lapak bazar UMKM</h3><p class=\"plan__desc\">Lapak terbuka untuk kelompok usaha lokal di bazar hari Sabtu.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"plan__price\"><span class=\"plan__amount\"><span class=\"plan__currency\">Rp</span><span class=\"roll\" data-per-seat data-price-month=\"30\" data-price-year=\"25\" data-lds-roll-label=\"{n} ribu rupiah per bulan\"></span></span><span class=\"plan__period morph\" data-lds-morph data-billing-month=\"ribu per bulan untuk {seats} lapak\" data-billing-year=\"ribu per bulan untuk {seats} lapak\">ribu per bulan untuk 10 lapak</span></div>\n      <div class=\"plan__seats\"><span id=\"pl-s\">Lapak</span><div class=\"stepper-field\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"pl-s\" data-lds-stepper data-min=\"5\" data-max=\"200\" data-value=\"10\"><button aria-label=\"Kurangi lapak\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">remove</span></button><span class=\"stepper-field__value\"><span class=\"roll\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></span><button aria-label=\"Tambah lapak\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">add</span></button></div></div>\n      <div class=\"plan__cta\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--block\">Minta rincian untuk kelompok</button></div>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
